@startuml UC56A_SystemAutoNotification
!theme plain
title UC56A: Gửi thông báo hệ thống (tự động)

actor System
participant "Backend Service" as Service
participant "Socket.IO" as Socket
database "Database" as DB

' ========== Event: Booking confirmed ==========
Service -> Service: Event: Booking confirmed
Service -> DB: Tạo notification\n(type: "booking_updated", title: "Đặt phòng đã được xác nhận")
Service -> DB: Set recipients\n(userId: customerId, role: customer)
DB --> Service: Notification created

Service -> Socket: Emit "new_notification"\n(notification data)
Socket -> Socket: Send to user\n(userId room)
Socket --> Frontend: Real-time notification

' ========== Event: Check-in/Check-out ==========
Service -> Service: Event: Check-in/Check-out
Service -> DB: Tạo notification\n(type: "booking_updated", title: "Đã check-in/out")
Service -> DB: Set recipients\n(userId: customerId, role: customer)
DB --> Service: Notification created

Service -> Socket: Emit "new_notification"
Socket --> Frontend: Real-time notification

' ========== Event: Payment received ==========
Service -> Service: Event: Payment received
Service -> DB: Tạo notification\n(type: "payment_received", title: "Đã nhận thanh toán")
Service -> DB: Set recipients\n(role: admin, staff)
DB --> Service: Notification created

Service -> Socket: Emit "new_notification"\n(to role:admin, role:staff rooms)
Socket --> Frontend: Real-time notification

' ========== Event: Booking cancelled ==========
Service -> Service: Event: Booking cancelled
Service -> DB: Tạo notification\n(type: "booking_cancelled", title: "Đặt phòng đã bị hủy")
Service -> DB: Set recipients\n(userId: customerId, role: admin, staff)
DB --> Service: Notification created

Service -> Socket: Emit "new_notification"
Socket --> Frontend: Real-time notification

note right
  Các sự kiện tự động:
  - Booking: confirmed, updated, cancelled
  - Payment: received, refunded, failed
  - Group booking: approved, quoted, confirmed
  - Check-in/Check-out
  - Service booking: completed, cancelled
end note
@enduml

